        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Konsep Dasar",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Rule/Scenario** — Aturan deteksi fraud yang terdiri dari beberapa kondisi\n• **Node** — Satu blok kondisi (CONSTANT, CONTAINS, LOGICAL, dll)\n• **Flow/Canvas** — Tempat merangkai node jadi satu alur deteksi\n• **Alert** — Hasil akhir jika kondisi terpenuhi\n• **Group** — Kumpulan node yang dikelompokkan biar rapi",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">📋 Rule</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">🔵 Node</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">🎨 Canvas</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#f0fdfa;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">🔔 Alert</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Persiapan",
